<title>USA: ING ups Bulgaria, Ecuador, Peru debt to overweight.</title>
<headline>ING ups Bulgaria, Ecuador, Peru debt to overweight.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings raised its recommended sovereign portfolio allocations for Bulgaria, Ecuador and Peru to overweight from underweight, ING said.</p>
<p>&quot;Progress in Bulgaria, overselling in Ecuador and improving headline numbers from Peru will contribute to these countries' outperformance,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>In addition, ING recommended rebalancing portfolios to put more weight in longer-duration assets on an interest-rate and sovereign-spread basis.</p>
<p>(( -- Emerging Markets Unit, 212 859-1660 ))</p>
